# CI and release surface.
# Anything under here decides what runs in CI, which secrets that run can read, and what
# reaches the VM. A change to it deserves a review from whoever owns the pipeline, not only
# from whoever owns the application code.
# Deliberately scoped: no global owner, so ordinary code changes do not put the pipeline
# owner on every pull request. On the current GitHub plan this file requests a review and
# does not block a merge.

/.github/                      @mime-pi
/deploy/                       @mime-pi
/release-please-config.json    @mime-pi
/.release-please-manifest.json @mime-pi
